"罗伦","text":"白发萧萧思满巾，炉香不动闭关心。\n等閒欲问春消息，梅树枝头看浅深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10847,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题吕豸读书处","author":"罗伦","text":"好山端为此君来，竹径茅堂次第开。\n曾向读书台上望，西风吹尽陌中埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10848,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题饶雯峰梅二首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"万古清香横宇宙，几枝疏影照寒晖。\n玉堂不识孤山趣，长日无言对紫薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10849,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题饶雯峰梅二首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"六合空无一点埃，暗香多在雪中来。\n柴门长日无人到，强半诗怀为汝开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10850,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梅宰入觐","author":"罗伦","text":"千树东风满上林，九重春意待君深。\n孤舟一片梅花月，照见离明万里心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10851,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杨庆陈伟归安庆二首 其一","author":"罗伦","text":"罗浮春色自君来，万叠云山紫翠开。\n无限风光皆落手，袖中归去有蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":10852,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送杨庆陈伟归安庆二首 其二","author":"罗伦","text":"浮云残雨总潇然，留得羲皇太古天。\n明月满船湖上路，棹歌光霁杳无边。","col